
# --- GOLDEN FIXTURE (see docs/guests/ubuntu.md) ---
# Ubuntu 4.10 Warty Warthog live CD. The vmstate lives in ubuntu.qcow2 (empty 1G
# carrier); the ISO is read-only. Disk + ISO + launcher are an atomic set.
# Golden baked 2026-09-03 on a /data/vms/sandbox/ubuntu-golden/bake clone (exact
# launcher device set): VM_SIZE=255 MiB, VM_CLOCK=0000:05:55.667 (qemu-img
# snapshot -l). Restore-proven: killed by pidfile, relaunched with
# -loadvm golden -S, QMP cont, fb-wait --settle 3 landed in 3.3s on the same
# idle desktop. Screen shipped at 640x480 (XFree86 vesa, no DDC) — the
# 1024x768 attempt was not reached inside the golden stream's time budget;
# see docs/lab/UBUNTU-WAVE.md ## Golden.
SH_RESET_MODE=loadvm
SH_GOLDEN_SNAPSHOT=golden
SH_RESET_MONITOR=/data/vms/streamhost/stations/ubuntu/reset-hmp.sock
SH_FIXTURE_DESC="Ubuntu 4.10 live session as 'warty' on the idle 640x480 GNOME 2.8 desktop; screensaver off; absolute USB tablet and keyboard ready"
SH_BASE_BACKUP=/data/gallery-guests/Ubuntu/ubuntu.qcow2.bak-pre-golden
